WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:29.560
16 billion euros is amazon's 2027 Germany spend on data centers, satellites, and video. This is MAG 7 Daily, episode 28. After the Germany check, a US blacklist tied to google's ai secrets, Australia's plan to sue facebook, the case against reading that pledge as pure a capacity, then how google, amazon, and microsoft are trying to put agents into daily operations, and the dates. Bloomberg put amazon's Germany pledge at more than that euro figure,

00:00:29.560 --> 00:00:32.720
year, $17.9 billion dollars for next year.

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:38.200
The company said the same plan covers AI infrastructure, a wider logistics footprint,

00:00:38.540 --> 00:00:41.460
and work with the European space industry on Amazon Leo.

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:46.720
Amazon also committed to more sustainable infrastructure and to water stewardship across

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:47.220
Germany.

00:00:47.780 --> 00:00:53.280
Since 2010, Amazon said it has invested over 100 billion euros in the country.

00:00:54.235 --> 00:00:58.895
Washington blacklisted a Chinese venture firm that former Microsoft AI scientist

00:00:58.895 --> 00:01:04.595
Liu Qi established. Bloomberg reported, over alleged ties to a start-up accused of stealing

00:01:04.595 --> 00:01:09.635
technology from Alphabet's Google. The information reported sanctions on five Chinese

00:01:09.635 --> 00:01:14.475
entities linked to Lin Wei Ding, a former Google software engineer sentenced to prison

00:01:14.475 --> 00:01:20.255
last month for stealing Google's AI trade secrets. One of them is the start-up Shanghai Zishuan

00:01:20.255 --> 00:01:26.475
technology, described as an AI company connected to Ding. The list also includes a Chinese venture

00:01:26.475 --> 00:01:32.335
capital firm tied to that case. Australia is preparing lawsuits against Facebook, TikTok,

00:01:32.655 --> 00:01:37.035
and other major platforms. Communications Minister Annika Wells told Bloomberg.

00:01:37.655 --> 00:01:42.735
The allegation is non-compliance with a nationwide social media ban for people under 16.

00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:49.530
The Barcelona Supercomputing Center's AI Factory Accelerator is now in full operation after a pilot,

00:01:50.090 --> 00:01:53.690
and Vidya's newsroom said. Startups in it get sovereign compute,

00:01:53.690 --> 00:01:58.850
Institute, technical support, and training, and many already sit in Nvidia's Inception program,

00:01:59.150 --> 00:02:01.490
with further program access starting today.

00:02:02.475 --> 00:02:07.695
What cuts against reading Amazon's Germany pledge as an AI data center build is a smaller

00:02:07.695 --> 00:02:09.435
line on the company's own page.

00:02:09.995 --> 00:02:16.175
Amazon itemized 4.8 billion euros to expand AWS Cloud and AI infrastructure in Germany.

00:02:16.755 --> 00:02:20.835
That is the figure that decides how much of the headline is Cloud and AI capacity.

00:02:20.835 --> 00:02:26.815
18,000 Cognizant Associates are the staff behind a new Gemini Frontier Capability Group

00:02:26.815 --> 00:02:32.655
that Cognizant and Google Cloud are standing up so Enterprise agents leave pilots and run in production.

00:02:33.295 --> 00:02:39.615
ROI and J reported that the group extends a Gemini practice Cognizant opened in April, 2026.

00:02:40.215 --> 00:02:44.035
More than 55,000 associates finished a build with Gemini Workshop,

00:02:44.535 --> 00:02:48.395
which Cognizant called the largest single Gemini Partner Workshop so far.

00:02:48.395 --> 00:02:56.755
Chief Executive Ravi Kumar S said that workshop put those associates on the platform, and that the new group is where the experience goes to work.

00:02:57.255 --> 00:03:05.855
Google Cloud Chief Executive Thomas Curian said joint customers need that kind of architectural partner if autonomous agents are going to spread through a company.

00:03:06.395 --> 00:03:14.855
The first jobs named are legacy modernization, developer experience, turning business processes into agents, and frontier cyber defense.

00:03:14.855 --> 00:03:20.955
Cognizant said the design is security first, built on the model context protocol and Google

00:03:20.955 --> 00:03:22.195
Cloud's model armor.

00:03:22.915 --> 00:03:28.035
Early name tools include a retail catalog support agent, a healthcare agent marketplace

00:03:28.035 --> 00:03:33.095
orchestrated by Neurosand, and multi-agent order to cash flows for manufacturing.

00:03:33.735 --> 00:03:40.175
In one retail software case, Cognizant said developer productivity rose 40%, time to market

00:03:40.175 --> 00:03:43.815
fell 30%, and costs fell 35%.

00:03:43.815 --> 00:03:49.495
Cognizant is deploying Gemini to 100,000 of its own associates this year, with a plan

00:03:49.495 --> 00:03:50.955
to reach 200,000.

00:03:51.375 --> 00:03:57.155
Amazon introduced Torch Neuron, an open-source toolkit that lets PyTorch jobs run on AWS

00:03:57.155 --> 00:03:59.715
Trainiam chips without a large rewrite.

00:04:00.395 --> 00:04:04.735
SiliconANGLE reported, a developer sets which chip the workload should use.

00:04:05.175 --> 00:04:09.815
The toolkit supports Trainiam 2 and Trainiam 3, for training and for inference.

00:04:09.815 --> 00:04:15.475
Trainium 3 has 8 computing cores, and each core has 4 modules aimed at different parts

00:04:15.475 --> 00:04:16.015
of the math.

00:04:16.615 --> 00:04:20.355
Model data sits in 154 gigabytes of memory on the chip.

00:04:21.095 --> 00:04:25.815
AWS packs the accelerators into servers that can hold up to 144 of them.

00:04:26.375 --> 00:04:32.475
Amazon said one of those systems can do up to 362 quadrillion calculations a second in

00:04:32.475 --> 00:04:34.115
the MX-FP8 format.

00:04:34.795 --> 00:04:40.355
Trainiam's own language, NKI, arrives as ready-made operators for mixture of experts designs,

00:04:41.015 --> 00:04:46.615
lower memory use and quantization. Torch Titan is supported, including a split that shares the

00:04:46.615 --> 00:04:53.195
model, the optimizer states, and the gradients across chips. Cartezia AI is already running inference

00:04:53.195 --> 00:04:58.795
on Trainiam with the toolkit. The Libre Institute for Brain Development is looking at it for medical

00:04:58.795 --> 00:05:04.855
work flows. Amazon said the open source drop is Tuesday, day one of a two-day

00:05:04.855 --> 00:05:09.755
pie-torch conference in San Jose. Microsoft's addition in this set is model

00:05:09.755 --> 00:05:16.335
names, not a new chip. Geeky Gadgets reported co-pilot added OpenAI's GPT 6.1

00:05:16.335 --> 00:05:24.095
and Anthropics Clawed Opus 5.5. Also today, Nvidia unveiled Nemotron Super VL, a

00:05:24.095 --> 00:05:27.895
120 billion parameter model, data economy reported.

